    "summary": "Super-heavy Walker applies to three move types: Normal, Advance and Fall Back. The model can cross terrain up to 4″ high and can pass over other models unless they have TITANIC. It may pass through enemy Engagement Range. Finish the move clear of that range. If the route crossed terrain taller than 4″, roll a D6 after completing the move. A result of 1 leaves the mover Battle-shocked.",
